        "rule": "Disjoint check的“alarm text”按以下优先级确定:\n1. 当violation unit为1时,取 “Contradiction found. ”,接着是subject label,接着是“ is recorded as both parent and spouse of ”,接着是object label,接着是“. Check those facts and the selected disjoint rule.”;\n2. 其余情况取 空字符串。",
